{"id":"n56109-1-7","stage":2,"title":"마침 · 正好","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56109-1-7-1","ko":"여보세요, 나 민준이야.","zh":"喂，我是敏俊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여보세요,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"여보세요：喂","readings":[{"term":"여보세요","audio":"/audio/9cbcfc6759228a233380.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17866","senseId":"1","lemma":"여보세요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이야.","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"민준이야","audio":"/audio/de215e278c0773f4a6d4.mp3"}],"sources":[]}],"words":[{"id":"9cbcfc6759228a23","term":"여보세요","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/9cbcfc6759228a233380.mp3","entryId":"17866","definition":"用于通话时招呼对方。","pronunciation":["여보세요"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]}],"audio":"/audio/621f4c68ea00694bcdf9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56109-1-7-2","ko":"그래, 마침 전화하려고 했는데.","zh":"是啊，我正好也打算打电话给你呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마침","meaning":"正好，正巧","explanation":"마침：正好，正巧","readings":[{"term":"마침","audio":"/audio/4b10fb22324c4af9aef0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56109","senseId":"1","lemma":"마침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전화하려고","meaning":"打电话，通话","explanation":"전화하다：打电话，通话；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"전화하다","audio":"/audio/aa1e3e09fae7e076a6a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70847","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했는데.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"4b10fb22324c4af9","term":"마침","zh":"正好，正巧","audio":"/audio/4b10fb22324c4af9aef0.mp3","entryId":"56109","definition":"很偶然地与某个机会或情况恰好吻合。","pronunciation":["마침"]},{"id":"aa1e3e09fae7e076","term":"전화하다","zh":"打电话，通话","audio":"/audio/aa1e3e09fae7e076a6a6.mp3","entryId":"70847","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈。","pronunciation":["전ː화하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e6942515bb6c9515d080.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.827,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56109","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3791,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，我正好也打算打电话给你呢。","我好像昨天在大家面前说错了话。","喂，我是敏俊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，我正好也打算打电话给你呢。","喂，我是敏俊。","我好像昨天在大家面前说错了话。"],"answer":0}]}
